From: Enceka <enceka@yeah.net>
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: add isolated PON NPU return diagnostics

Allow an explicitly selected RAM diagnostic to send PON frames through
an empty AUTH table and back through Ethernet Return. Keep optical flow
qualification closed and bank1 learning disabled throughout the session.
Bind the session to its netdevice and controller; retain ownership until
close and register restoration finish. Capture ER evidence only on request.

